        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906270/extras/6dfef5f69548cb549a24583fc0f41d94.webp?t=1776455894\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906270/extras/6dfef5f69548cb549a24583fc0f41d94.poster.avif?t=1776455894\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=335 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find hidden cats in the charming and historic city of Istanbul! Start with an uncolored scene and relax as you color the streets, explore landmarks, and meet special furry friends to collect unique cards. A cozy, family-friendly hidden object adventure full of charm and color! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More than 830 hidden objects to find!!! </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find the cats and paint the city.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Look for special cats and unlock bonus levels.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover Istanbul's Landmarks.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect many cards and earn achievements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the radar to help search for cats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Sound FX</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exclusive Soundtrack</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906270/extras/7b96074bfffe40b3a6f9242522229bce.webp?t=1776455894\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906270/extras/7b96074bfffe40b3a6f9242522229bce.poster.avif?t=1776455894\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=172 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Level - Istanbul</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200 cats to find.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 Special Cats that unlock bonus levels and give hints. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 20 city people to help you earn radar hints.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bonus Levels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels with different sizes and numbers of kittens to find.    </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hookah Cafe:</strong> 50 kittens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hammam: </strong>50 kittens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Candy Store:</strong> 50 kittens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gülhane Park:</strong> 75 kittens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grand Bazaar</strong>: 100 kittens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blue Mosque:</strong> 100 kittens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balat Festival:</strong> 100 kittens + 50 people</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Accessibility</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invert Mouse Zoom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse Drag Sensitivity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Edge Screen Scrolling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Color Blindness</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906270/extras/6dfef5f69548cb549a24583fc0f41d94.webp?t=1776455894\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906270/extras/6dfef5f69548cb549a24583fc0f41d94.poster.avif?t=1776455894\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=335 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find hidden cats in the charming and historic city of Istanbul! Start with an uncolored scene and relax as you color the streets, explore landmarks, and meet special furry friends to collect unique cards. A cozy, family-friendly hidden object adventure full of charm and color! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More than 830 hidden objects to find!!! </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find the cats and paint the city.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Look for special cats and unlock bonus levels.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover Istanbul's Landmarks.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect many cards and earn achievements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the radar to help search for cats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Sound FX</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exclusive Soundtrack</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906270/extras/7b96074bfffe40b3a6f9242522229bce.webp?t=1776455894\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906270/extras/7b96074bfffe40b3a6f9242522229bce.poster.avif?t=1776455894\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=172 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main 